  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given initially a resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected in the left gap and let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected in the right gap of meter bridge and the null point is obtained at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>,</p><p>From the balanced condition of the Wheatstone&nbsp;bridge&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the resistance per unit length of meter bridge wire than</p><p>For wire&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;for NB wire&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>On substituting the values from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>40</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Now an unknown resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected in series with the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;resistance and the null point is obtained at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>l</mi></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi></math></p><p>Then from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>80</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>80</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>80</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p>"
